SLIDE 6 — CHALLENGES & FUTURE DEPLOYMENT
Current Challenges
🔴 Clinical Validation

Current risk/distress detection is a prototype and requires validation against real-world dementia-care scenarios.

🔴 Consent & Privacy

Healthcare data requires strict consent lifecycle management, retention policies and access enforcement.

🔴 AI Safety

The system must continuously prevent hallucinated personal information and unsafe responses.

🔴 Real-World Data

The prototype currently needs larger, representative datasets for stronger risk modelling.

🚀 What We Will Deploy Next
1. Intelligent Medical Record Processing

Doctor/Caregiver uploads patient PDF

→ Extract clinical data + dementia stage + functional abilities + personal information

→ Human verification

→ Patient profile

